{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Publish revocation before exposing the missing token.** `checkpointToken` becomes null before `handleMissingToken()` sets `checkpointTokenRevoked`. A queued worker can start in this window, observe `false`, execute user side effects, and then fail to checkpoint, causing duplicate execution on replay. Read the response token into a local and publish nonterminal revocation before assigning null or otherwise releasing workers; add a latch-based test for this window.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-B5La","finding_digest":"031be425b8c365696fcea7803b2dacf3fa538e7c5ea3854189a9b8de8ea160a1","finding_id":"arf_v1_amn6ijnyynsws36ou6adwlnm6p","finding_key":"sdk/execution/checkpointmanager::handlemissingtoken::revocation-before-worker-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/checkpointmanager::handlemissingtoken::revocation-before-worker-release","line":278,"observation_digest":"6cbbdcaef89c7107887b48fd57ceb5682add4f931d7c50c29fd7d62877e4e2e7","observation_id":"aro_v1_ns55zlxytryqpcd3jd6vptvvna","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/CheckpointManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_amn6ijnyynsws36ou6adwlnm6p","published_at":"2026-10-13T17:30:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ffjxzemgtsu4nxvuadis2ybagc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2c313b2a78321d70492785d77d5559aba562d50c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":778},"record_id":"art_v1_ipeym635t4amr5ll5uuczkv3uc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T17:30:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
